WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- Look at us.

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.920
- I just love that you've been married,

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:03.720
in my world, for years.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.010
- Well, I was married once before,

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.100
a while ago.
- I was like, no, no,

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.240
I thought to him.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.073
- Oh to him?

00:00:08.073 --> 00:00:09.570
- Because you sent me videos
of y'all on vacation like--

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:10.451
- I know--

00:00:10.451 --> 00:00:11.284
- I love them.

00:00:11.284 --> 00:00:12.117
They're the best--
- I know,

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:12.950
- Married couple.
- By the way,

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:13.882
I love drunk texting Kelly.

00:00:13.882 --> 00:00:14.715
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:14.715 --> 00:00:17.248
When we're out, I'm like
"Hey, Kelly. It's us."

00:00:17.248 --> 00:00:18.081
- It's my favorite.

00:00:18.081 --> 00:00:19.380
- You're probably like,
"What is she doing?"

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.410
- No, I have a few
friends in the limelight

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:22.601
that randomly do that.

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:23.434
[Hoda] I love doing it.

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:24.267
- Pentatonix are one as well.

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:25.550
[Hoda] Pentatonix?
- And it's great.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.298
Yeah I'm like y'all should not do this.

00:00:27.298 --> 00:00:28.247
This is black mail.

00:00:28.247 --> 00:00:29.558
I have black mail.

00:00:29.558 --> 00:00:30.391
(laughing)

00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:31.224
- I never do that.

00:00:31.224 --> 00:00:32.220
I'm afraid people will show it.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.784
Never send that to Blake Shelton.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:35.930
- Oh.
(laughing)

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:36.860
- Never.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:39.370
I know you love Blake, but he will take-

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:40.460
- I don't trust.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.012
- Never trust him with something
important footage wise.

00:00:43.012 --> 00:00:43.845
[Hoda] What did he do?

00:00:43.845 --> 00:00:46.363
- No, I, I, just don't trust him.

